{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:c94e9876e3ba371d","name":"Coup de Grace","source":{"id":"source:reference-c94e9876e3ba371d","title":"Coup de Grace","revision":18062,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T19:31:44Z","sha256":"c029e885a7ac757be2d00412de449bbb70bd9a4f7916bcb1f45830feda634059","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18062","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Coup%20de%20Grace&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-c94e9876e3ba371d","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Core Rulebook"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Core_Rulebook"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Full-Round Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Full-Round_Action"},", you can use a melee weapon to deliver a Coup de Grace to a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Helpless"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Helpless"}," target. You can also use a ranged weapon, provided you are adjacent to the target. You automatically score a Critical Hit, dealing double damage. A defender reduced to 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," by a Coup de Grace dies instantly, or, in the case of a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Droid"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Droid"},", is destroyed. An ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unconscious"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unconscious"}," or ",{"tag":"a","children":["Disabled"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Disabled"}," defender hit by a Coup de Grace also dies or is destroyed instantly.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["You can't deliver a Coup de Grace against a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle"}," or object.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
